;***  followerAgent.NLS  (contains all the code for the  follower Agent)                                                                                    ****
;*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
; DESCRIPTION OF THE AGENT
; followerAgent represents the "follower" agents in the model. 
; They are reactive to their environment and have a simple decision hierarchy that prioritizes immediate surroundings and influencer choices. 
; They can be influenced by nearby agentAs, but also have a boredom mechanic that may cause them to switch influencers or wander if they feel "unstimulated". 
; They can also be "converted" by excited followers.
;
;*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
;*********************************************************************************************************************************************************
